# SRC-TDS — project2, a deliberately *different* migration project.
#
# This file exists to test the claim in mvp-plan-30072026.md §4: that a second project
# ships as configuration and the engine is not touched. It differs from project1 in every
# way a real 2027 project would:
#
#   * different field names (DEP_REF, OWNER_NO, SEG_CODE …)
#   * a different subset of the record — PRODUCT is not carried at all
#   * a different exclusion predicate (`not_in` rather than `in`) — historical; the
#     engine no longer has a filter stage (D1), the predicate difference is preserved
#     only as a comment for context
#   * transforms project1 never uses (`const`, `concat`)
#   * the delimited layout rather than the copybook one
#
# It reads the same physical extract, which is the point: the layout coordinates and the
# field naming are both data, so a new project reinterprets the same bytes without a line
# of engine code changing.
#
# Homogeneous definition (D6): every field is `.DAT`. As with project1, enrichment
# fields (tier, outlet, riskBand) are joined downstream, not carried here.

record DEPOSIT
  layout fixed  width=59
  layout csv    delimiter=|  header=true

  field DEP_REF     offset=0   len=12  col=0  type=string   required=true
  field OWNER_NO    offset=12  len=10  col=1  type=string   required=true
  field SEG_CODE    offset=22  len=4   col=2  type=string   required=true
  field CCY         offset=32  len=3   col=4  type=string   required=true
  field START_DT    offset=35  len=8   col=5  type=date     required=true
  field ST          offset=43  len=1   col=6  type=string   required=true
  field AMT         offset=44  len=15  col=7  type=decimal  scale=2  required=true
